[Fact:spectrumcomputing:Spectrum Computing]
<a href="https://spectrumcomputing.co.uk/entry/6527/ZX-Spectrum/Kentilla"
  rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Kentilla</a>
(Derek Brewster, Micromega 1984; Mastertronic 1986 reissue).

[Fact:reviewer:Reviewed With His Own Ratings]
Derek Brewster wrote CRASH's Adventure Trail column and rated each adventure
under five headings. When Your Spectrum reviewed his own adventure Kentilla,
it marked the game the same way; one of its three reviewers gave it 2 out of
5. Source:
<a href="https://code198x.com/vault/people/derek-brewster/"
  rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">code198x.com</a>.
